ose is Safeguarding the World's Most Vital ResourcesTM. Our diverse group of leading operating companies provide essential technology solutions that monitor, enhance and protect key resources around the globe. We are committed to the advancement of public health and safety and believe we are positioned to support our customers as they address large global challenges including environmental resource sustainability, water scarcity, management of severe weather events, food and pharmaceutical security, and the impact of an aging workforce. For decades, we have used our scientific expertise and innovative technologies to address complex challenges our customers face across regulated industries – including municipal utilities, food and beverage, pharmaceutical and industrials – where the consequence of failure is high. Through our core offerings in water ana","zh":"Veralto 公司的統一目標是保護世界上最重要的資源TM。我們多元化的領先營運公司團隊提供監控、增強和保護全球關鍵資源的基本技術解決方案。我們致力於促進公共衛生和安全，並相信我們有能力為客戶提供支持，幫助他們應對巨大的全球挑戰，包括環境資源永續性、水資源短缺、惡劣天氣事件管理、食品和藥品安全以及勞動力老化的影響。幾十年來，我們利用我們的科學專業知識和創新技術來解決客戶在受監管行業（包括市政公用事業、食品和飲料、製藥和工業）中面臨的複雜挑戰，這些行業的失敗後果很高。透過我們在水分析領域的核心產品"},{"en":"Veralto Corporation is a Delaware corporation and was incorporated in 2023 in connection with the separation of Veralto from Danaher Corporation (\"Danaher\" or \"Former Parent\") on September 30, 2023 as an independent, publicly traded company, listed on the New York Stock Exchange (the \"Separation\"). At the time of the Separation, Veralto Corporation consisted of Danaher's former Environmental & Applied Solutions segment. The Separation was effectuated through a pro-rata dividend distribution on September 30, 2023 of all of the issued and outstanding shares of Veralto common stock held by Danaher as of September 13, 2023. Each Danaher stockholder of record as of the close of business on September 13, 2023 received one share of Veralto common stock for every three shares of Danaher common stock held on the record date.","zh":"Veralto Corporation 是一家特拉華州公司，於 2023 年註冊成立，當時 Veralto 於 2023 年 9 月 30 日從丹納赫公司（「丹納赫」或「前母公司」）分拆，成為一家獨立的上市公司，在紐約證券交易所上市（「分拆」）。分離時，Veralto 公司由丹納赫前環境與應用解決方案部門組成。此次分拆是透過於 2023 年 9 月 30 日對丹納赫截至 2023 年 9 月 13 日持有的所有已發行和流通的 Veralto 普通股按比例進行股息分配而實現的。截至 2023 年 9 月 13 日營業結束時記錄在案的每位丹納赫股東，在記錄日期每持有 3 股丹納赫普通股即可獲得一股 Veralto 普通股。"},{"en":"Veralto operates through two segments – Water Quality (\"WQ\") and Product Quality & Innovation (\"PQI\"). Our businesses within these segments have strong globally recognized brands as a result of our leadership in served markets over several decades. Our WQ segment provides innovative products and services that improve the quality and reliability of water with leading brands including Hach, Trojan Technologies and ChemTreat. Our PQI segment enables our customers to promote consumer trust in their products and help enable product innovation with leading brands including Videojet, Linx, Esko, X-Rite and Pantone. We believe our leading positions result from the strength of our commercial organizations, our legacy of innovation, and our close and long-term connectivity to our customers and knowledge of their workflows, underpinned by our culture of continuous improvement. This has resulted in ","zh":"Veralto 透過兩個部門運作－水質部門（「WQ」）和產品品質與創新部門（「PQI」）。由於我們幾十年來在所服務的市場中處於領先地位，我們在這些領域的業務擁有強大的全球認可品牌。我們的 WQ 部門透過 Hach、Trojan Technologies 和 ChemTreat 等領先品牌提供創新產品和服務，提高水的品質和可靠性。我們的 PQI 部門使我們的客戶能夠提高消費者對其產品的信任，並幫助實現偉迪捷、Linx、Esko、X-Rite 和 Pantone 等領先品牌的產品創新。我們相信，我們的領先地位源於我們商業組織的實力、我們的創新傳統、我們與客戶的長期密切聯繫以及對他們工作流程的了解，並以我們持續改進的文化為基礎。這導致了"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Veralto operates through two segments – Water Quality (\"WQ\") and Product Quality & Innovation (\"PQI\"). Our businesses within these segments have strong globally recognized brands as a result of our leadership in served markets over several decades. Our WQ segment provides innovative products and services that improve the quality and reliability of water with leading brands including Hach, Trojan Technologies and ChemTreat. Our PQI segment enables our customers to promote consumer trust in their products and help enable product innovation with leading brands including Videojet, Linx, Esko, X-Rite and Pantone. We believe our leading positions result from the strength of our commercial organizations, our legacy of innovation, and our close and long-term connectivity to our customers and knowledge of their workflows, underpinned by our culture of continuous improvement. This has resulted in ","zh":"Veralto 透過兩個部門運作－水質部門（「WQ」）和產品品質與創新部門（「PQI」）。由於我們幾十年來在所服務的市場中處於領先地位，我們在這些領域的業務擁有強大的全球認可品牌。我們的 WQ 部門透過 Hach、Trojan Technologies 和 ChemTreat 等領先品牌提供創新產品和服務，提高水的品質和可靠性。我們的 PQI 部門使我們的客戶能夠提高消費者對其產品的信任，並幫助實現偉迪捷、Linx、Esko、X-Rite 和 Pantone 等領先品牌的產品創新。我們相信，我們的領先地位源於我們商業組織的實力、我們的創新傳統、我們與客戶的長期密切聯繫以及對他們工作流程的了解，並以我們持續改進的文化為基礎。這導致了"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Water Quality","val":3321000000,"zh":"水質部門"},{"name":"Product & Quality Innovation","val":2182000000,"zh":"產品與品質創新部門"}],"total":5503000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Revenuefrom Contractwith Customer Measurement Recurring","val":3359000000,"zh":"與客戶定期測量的合約收入"},{"name":"Revenuefrom Contractwith Customer Measurement Nonrecurring","val":2144000000,"zh":"與客戶簽訂的合約收入計量非經常性"}],"total":5503000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":2639000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"High Growth Markets","val":1505000000,"zh":"高成長市場"},{"name":"Western Europe","val":1241000000,"zh":"西歐"},{"name":"Other Developed Markets","val":118000000,"zh":"其他已開發市場"}],"total":5503000000}},"peers":["RVTY","FTV","EG","CPAY","BALL"]}}